%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=701adcfaeb359ccbe8c054903cdf05da, https://si.imgix.net/6a1b36f6/uploads/origins/c91499ff-74fa-433d-92b5-18ab3ac4f953?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9aa234f743a62ef40e2ddd42d4cb72e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6a1b36f6/uploads/origins/c91499ff-74fa-433d-92b5-18ab3ac4f953?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfe28e39add00c9ef76b9a9346e945e8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんは！めいママのイラストに一目惚れしてリクエスト投げました！\nポース・表情おまかせで、衣装は資料URLのでおねがいします！\n使用用途は、動画・配信・サムネ・おはVなどに使用します！\n透過背景があると嬉しいです！\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1KnaY9qlCRcGMa0NLKAyOayAniuNXCqTr/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@muu54682/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/864407d7/uploads/origins/a1613b44-5105-4095-9e95-42523bff0a16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33ca40a8475bd307d0c7c5fced8afd1f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/864407d7/uploads/origins/a1613b44-5105-4095-9e95-42523bff0a16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=33ca40a8475bd307d0c7c5fced8afd1f, https://si.imgix.net/864407d7/uploads/origins/a1613b44-5105-4095-9e95-42523bff0a16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1cd2e9d470992417887ecb3d22fc7b5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/864407d7/uploads/origins/a1613b44-5105-4095-9e95-42523bff0a16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=36212e846a41b409174